      "id": "2057367593116467260",
      "text": "A simple game mechanic loop: collect 3 energy cells before your health bar runs out, then find the portal and proceed to the next level. Spectators get to vote on which world you’re sent to next…",
      "quotedText": "We gave a code harness to a video world model, and built a game you can play on Roblox…",
      "quotedUrl": "https://x.com/AlbyHojel/status/2057262246049599653",
